<h2 local-id=3D"95780375a909" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-1.ExecutiveS=
ummary">1. Executive Summary</h2>
<p local-id=3D"04fd594f167d">CareerPilot is a job search copilot that aggre=
gates vacancies from public job lists, scores each one against a complete c=
andidate profile with transparent evidence, generates tailored application =
documents for user approval, and tracks every application in one place. Job=
 seekers today repeat searches across boards, cannot judge their fit, and d=
istrust rankings shaped by ads and premium tiers; competitors Jobscan, Hunt=
r and JobCopilot match on CV wording or automate volume, not fit. The MVP l=
aunches in Germany in June 2027, a fixed Q2 deadline set by investors, free=
 for job seekers within 10 daily credits, and is judged on share of matches=
 =E2=89=A5 90%, profile completeness, application-to-interview rate, retent=
ion, abandonment and score trust.</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"9bdeb7c5fde5">Positioning: CareerPilot explains whether a ca=
ndidate fits a job and why, and lets verified headhunters match their own j=
ob descriptions against CareerPilot=E2=80=99s opted-in profiles to receive =
candidates with 90% or higher CV=E2=80=93JD fit and confirmed immediate ava=
ilability. Evidence-based matching connects both sides without paid ranking=
 boosts.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"9ba6007c2749"><strong><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(2=
48,230,160);">Notation:</span></strong><span style=3D"background-color: rgb=
(248,230,160);"> statements not supported by the ideation, personas or brie=
f are marked.</span></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"6f40cc6d41f7" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Confirmeddec=
isions">Confirmed decisions</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"c=
b77051c1fce" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9578c409ed06">
<th data-local-id=3D"063481d8fb31" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ab30517ae857">Topic</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a773121875ec" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3afac0d37b2e">Decision</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"18855a7eb678">
<td data-local-id=3D"110fcb0abae0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b3fa230e862f">Markets</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"df64aadf7eaa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6d1ef36b8230">Germany</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"364abc433d85">
<td data-local-id=3D"54628329a181" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8d5ab30e332">Languages</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"313af5acaa87" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0cc9017251ed">German and English for the interface, job ad a=
nalysis and generated documents</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d1161f02d969">
<td data-local-id=3D"07c3b7d541a1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f4cdcedd8bd9">Business model</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ee3ebab42b64" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e2172c81915b">MVP funded by investors and free for job seeke=
rs within 10 daily credits. After launch: employers pay per job ad and for =
talent search (employer login), and job seekers can pay as they apply: a pr=
epaid wallet (top-up from =E2=82=AC10) buys 10-credit packs at =E2=82=AC0.9=
9; bought credits never expire. In the MVP the wallet shows as "Coming soon=
"</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5314fcdd36fe">
<td data-local-id=3D"50f60eb93671" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4600ae6886cf">Job sources</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"77c9fa948557" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5e3395e6a977">MVP: public job lists of the Bundesagentur f=
=C3=BCr Arbeit; Apply opens the original posting on the job site; no scrapi=
ng. Partner job feeds come with employer login after launch</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ae507ef80b45">
<td data-local-id=3D"b607c4b8b0a9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4aadfe464b7d">Usage limit</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a9a9af7e804f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8ca92cf812fc">10 credits per user per day; Prepare applicati=
on (detailed matching), CV, cover letter and interview prep cost 1 credit e=
ach, regenerations included; the match score is free</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"20be1fd45f00">
<td data-local-id=3D"a07d2ac034a5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d6a34f9b85c0">Team</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"62213e7d489b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3cf1e658665c">2 engineers, 1 ML engineer, 1 PM; 2-week sprin=
ts</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"69461535ac58">
<td data-local-id=3D"b2a2e9dbf3c0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"69afa8fc2bb7">Deadline</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2168148b7e70" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"518fa9246e13">Public launch in Q2 2027, fixed by investors</=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d60ef2cdf4d5">
<td data-local-id=3D"f2a856595b31" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"980edc7b7bd4">Free evidence</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8920bfb9b727" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4d9790d3784d">Match score, confidence, "How this score is ca=
lculated" and "Why it fits" (a few words, positives only); gaps, risks and =
the full evidence come with Prepare application (1 credit)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"063a1cc1b497">
<td data-local-id=3D"f4f73154799c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"60c8447eed1a">Cost target</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"74754991dbc2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d45ac5cf0c62">A complete application (Prepare, CV, cover let=
ter, interview prep: 4 credits) costs under =E2=82=AC0.01 in AI and infrast=
ructure at scale; if real costs are higher, the pack price rises</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5ff38876b832">
<td data-local-id=3D"ed02bfd5f1bd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"116c1bf5672b">Interview prep</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0ccbc0998a33" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c1c7da4613ec">Offered from the application history once the =
user confirms an application</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b526c5701a5f">
<td data-local-id=3D"03c2bb9b6af5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b95d33de324c">Sign-in</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4f881af262d6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8947641798d7">Standard SSO: Google, Microsoft, Apple, GitHub=
, LinkedIn</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"1916a40d3850" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Headhunterse=
rvice:controlledMVPpilot">Headhunter service: controlled MVP pilot</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a652ce0e47ef">CareerPilot also enables verified headhunters =
to submit a job description and receive an explained shortlist of opted-in =
candidate profiles with a CV=E2=80=93JD match of 90% or above and confirmed=
 immediate availability. The pilot supports human review and candidate-appr=
oved CV sharing; it does not make hiring decisions or automatically distrib=
ute CVs.</p>
<p local-id=3D"0ca5dd576b29">The candidate MVP remains free within 10 daily=
 credits. Pilot participation is invitation-only and investor-funded [ASSUM=
PTION]; broad employer search, paid employer ads, partner feeds and headhun=
ter pricing remain post-launch. The Germany, German/English and Q2 2027 con=
straints remain.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"60b03c1095e4" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-2.ProblemSta=
tement">2. Problem Statement</h2>
<p local-id=3D"5857b9d91aaa">Who: experienced and inexperienced job applica=
nts, represented by a senior professional, a recent graduate and a multilin=
gual expat, plus verified headhunters seeking highly matched, available can=
didates.</p>
<p local-id=3D"527139f097c9"><strong>What:</strong> the search and applicat=
ion process is fragmented, opaque and hard to manage alone.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b=
1eda2187c35" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 189.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 1009.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 600.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"24cbbc09e531">
<th data-local-id=3D"4555933043d3" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f32b00157b7a">ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"cefac9b065d3" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"21643747492e">Problem</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"e5c2d871e5fa" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9432dbb7b6bf">Most affected</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b9839c11e9ed">
<td data-local-id=3D"da8f0b2cee8b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"27fad4c46cfd">P1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5b044aff84b8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"455c045fa61c">Searching several job boards, re-running searc=
hes, filters and email alerts on each</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9270a3b3eadb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"07bc61c3ae7d">Markus, Andrei</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"52a53c0ea9f4">
<td data-local-id=3D"af6f481f561f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ff6fde4694c">P2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1ae64a139238" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"308d7c14727a">Too many offers to analyse and apply to alone<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eba5e11ca0ce" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a27d6a6e3720">Markus</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6f749656850c">
<td data-local-id=3D"8d8de77c1bfb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"99fb4b15c13f">P3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"00469c61f208" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0de2e216811a">Unclear whether one is qualified for a vacancy=
</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fabc410caf6a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1f01eea6f73b">Lena</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b8e3b0fef7fc">
<td data-local-id=3D"77de9a3349b2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bbf87cd942c6">P4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1db7ee9f871b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"140cf619afee">Applying to multilingual job ads</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"56bd4298798c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e34cad122819">Andrei</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"42c8bbd24cfe">
<td data-local-id=3D"ac7b66dd4308" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1c6d21ac83fd">P5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1a30d4e5963b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6aca59694e78">Losing track of where and when one applied</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7a025a15be24" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"24fd8fa0aded">Lena, Andrei</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d6f87a390217">
<td data-local-id=3D"5b4e0d5adc10" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1472ead28438">P6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e7402114c166" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"746fcb939274">Distrust of board matching influenced by ads a=
nd premium accounts; non-premium users notified later</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0c74f6af426d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cc20e62fcd0b">Markus, Lena</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"435bca365e05">
<td data-local-id=3D"8e4c05fe5ac6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"510ee455afcb">P7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6581112fe213" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"921971f50578">Exposure to data mining by fake recruiters</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"25f7d4af57e2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d38e614f2c3">Andrei</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"a96dccd65a60"><strong>Why it matters:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"c5db36c435b1">
<li local-id=3D"86f8117e2724">
<p local-id=3D"ff156198700d">Time spent on duplicate searches and rewriting=
 CVs leaves less time for strong, targeted applications.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e2101721257a">
<p local-id=3D"812ba41e4d37">Applicants who cannot judge fit either apply b=
lindly or self-select out of roles they could get.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4bbec0eb1dbd">
<p local-id=3D"1663b95941b2">Opaque or paid rankings erode trust in matchin=
g, so users re-check every ad by hand.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4576ad08feed">
<p local-id=3D"b9cf4d218657">Fake recruiters put personal data at risk.</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"530c40dcb3ce"><strong>Evidence:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"7e5d0004c5ee">
<li local-id=3D"4e405f8db5d3">
<p local-id=3D"1a02d909c27a">Ideation workshop findings P1=E2=80=93P7 and t=
he review notes on score transparency and profile completeness.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d4ef8b15b5bc">
<p local-id=3D"13d8adfadde0">Persona research: Markus receives about 60 ale=
rts a week from five boards; Lena has sent 40+ applications with 3 intervie=
ws (illustrative persona figures, not measured data).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae1cd504fab2">
<p local-id=3D"1bb934c77725">Competitor gap: Jobscan, Huntr and JobCopilot =
do not explain whether a low score reflects poor fit or missing profile dat=
a.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7d1a276a2104">
<p local-id=3D"ff3161ebc98e">No quantitative market data yet, user intervie=
ws or a survey are needed to size the problem.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"88cf6f6d8e36" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Headhunterpr=
oblemsandevidence">Headhunter problems and evidence</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e=
ac3d8d9-fe1a-40a8-a14c-92b898553f61" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cadb9193-cad9-4b23-9608-e00afded9687">
<th data-local-id=3D"1af83248-9df4-45b4-885a-26c30348a584" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2937f76ab9b3">ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"71185a50-4a36-4a3f-91bd-bf987ca893e5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ab7150bc3d7e">Problem</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"4fcef24d-b13e-416a-b5e5-cb6eb502c028" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bd9f4f46a8c2">Most affected</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cbffdbe8-a1b2-4669-bbb1-b40f26c8a221">
<td data-local-id=3D"cacc31fe-6538-4449-be8e-af25005d6cd0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bdf8283be452">P8</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7cac4123-b8de-43a2-b106-ba9bab88bf33" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bae0c4be92dc">Manual CV search produces many low-fit profile=
s and hides whether a candidate can start immediately.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c3d142a3-558f-42b0-ad1e-646e24d70f82" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2319eb99749c">Headhunter</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"212f0c22-088d-4405-b058-f1d427f2d740">
<td data-local-id=3D"2155a6ae-773b-4a53-9033-020df5c1de67" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"60978dfd77d5">P9</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7036ebec-6368-4b9c-a1ed-e243578cc4ed" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"156fbffe03a3">Candidates lack granular control over which re=
cruiters see their profile or receive their CV.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"de77f1ca-3c00-477a-ab60-d1f2f847765e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b8a2917d1c2e">All job seekers</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"c9e16430df02">Evidence: stakeholder request received 6 Octob=
er 2026. Recruiter demand, shortlist quality and willingness to participate=
 still require interviews; no measured market evidence is claimed. Availabi=
lity is candidate-declared, dated and independent of fit.</p>
