<h3 local-id=3D"bd27feb4e06b" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Userjourney"=
>User journey</h3>
<p local-id=3D"7c059ddbf6a7">The three job-seeker personas follow the same =
nine stages; the table shows the moment that matters most for each. Headhun=
ters follow the separate journey below.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d=
c2f971ae7ca" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"84ac4bb7e7e3">
<th data-local-id=3D"35d2ebc0822d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"877f0519069a">Stage</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"6aa17db5a513" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"060cf5ee02a2">Markus</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"2d329cff5caa" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ed6db5c36b4c">Lena</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a2addc1bb479" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fe417809e978">Andrei</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"678f4c3c2513">
<td data-local-id=3D"2cbd31dcb6aa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"04a2150e4783">Create Profile</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"83e305ec65cc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4d806dd95224">Sceptical of another account</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b76b70e0217a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b09af471d560">Fears a paywall</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a7d893869721" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"11307b9b4f2d">Reads privacy terms first</p></td>
