<p local-id=3D"6286ac737f5c">Time savings and counts in the journey are ill=
ustrative [ASSUMPTION].</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"f0aa6ff93a63" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Headhunterjo=
urney">Headhunter journey</h3>
<p local-id=3D"b864966142ae">Sign in =E2=86=92 verify recruiter and organis=
ation =E2=86=92 submit authorised JD =E2=86=92 confirm must-have criteria a=
nd desired start date =E2=86=92 receive eligible shortlist =E2=86=92 inspec=
t score, confidence, evidence and availability date =E2=86=92 request candi=
date consent =E2=86=92 candidate approves or declines =E2=86=92 view approv=
ed CV =E2=86=92 track response. No bulk CV download or automatic employer s=
ubmission.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"346947200583" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-4.GoalsandSu=
ccessMetrics">4. Goals and Success Metrics</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"eb1174f1f1bf" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Businessgoal=
s">Business goals</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"484bf9abb1ae">
<li local-id=3D"73ccb4d92a93">
<p local-id=3D"e5fd08146d46">BG1 Prove the score predicts outcomes: applica=
tions in the =E2=89=A5 90% band reach interviews measurably more often than=
 lower bands.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e7c4fc8c7642">
<p local-id=3D"f97818549916"><strong>BG2 Build the candidate base for post-=
launch revenue:</strong> employers will pay per job ad and for talent searc=
h, and job seekers pay for preparation credits (matching and fit scores sta=
y free); the MVP itself is investor-funded and free.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6ce1e8ce9b87">
<p local-id=3D"fc428e22501d"><strong>BG3 Win on trust:</strong> become the =
job tool users trust for neutral, explained rankings, in contrast to Jobsca=
n, Huntr and JobCopilot.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4ac4e0b679c5">
<p local-id=3D"1a6a184ff28f"><strong>BG4 Launch in Germany by the fixed Q2 =
2027 deadline</strong> with a validated beta cohort of about 500 users [ASS=
UMPTION].</p></li>
</ul>
