<h3 local-id=3D"319665ee0bdb" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Metrics">Met=
rics</h3>
<p local-id=3D"ff696fecf1c4"><strong>CareerPilot is a recruiting tool, not =
an engagement product. </strong>We succeed when a user finds a job that fit=
s and leaves. Time on the platform is not a goal, so a falling active-user =
count can be good news when hired exits drive it. The north star is therefo=
re success stories, not retention. Engagement and retention are measured on=
ly for users who are still searching, so they show whether the search is wo=
rking, not how long we keep people. Targets are [ASSUMPTION] starting point=
s to review after a four-week beta baseline. The user-set minimum fit (defa=
ult 90%) is fixed; reviewing targets must not lower it or inflate scores.</=
p>
<h4 local-id=3D"6104b3ae5d28" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Userlifecycl=
