east 2=C3=97 the &lt; 70% band</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7eb93ee1465c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9669f0c060e5">Depends on users updating statuses</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c159846ad4ee">
<td data-local-id=3D"5b195e0dae88" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1b56de73d61e">Match quality</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"669a983d67fd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6b8f8e5e5234">Expert-audited precision of jobs at or above t=
he user's minimum fit; % of digests with at least one such job</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f2d44332762e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"64931e0939dc">Precision =E2=89=A5 90% [ASSUMPTION]; digest s=
hare baseline in beta</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2d3a87790125" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a8ddd670138a">The list always shows 10 jobs, so do not read =
the score mix as quality; never inflate scores to fill it</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c8a04285cc01">
<td data-local-id=3D"20bbfb67855a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4f28f85a4510">Score trust and transparency use</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d39c2e3cb26e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"72eef7a25e8c">% of matches rated accurate (thumbs on evidenc=
e); % of score views where the user opens "How this score is calculated" an=
d then applies or skips in the same session</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8863e38853ad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da592060db5c">=E2=89=A5 90% rated accurate; =E2=89=A5 60% ex=
planation-to-decision</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b20afbfa24e7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"026da1d3016d">Low rating response rates</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"01b8470b746c">
<td data-local-id=3D"1e019d14ae05" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fffc43922435">Activation</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0fbaf07648cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2dbfdc3b719c">% of new users who reach Activated within 7 da=
ys</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"81e7d1089235" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0e865ab32c0a">=E2=89=A5 60% [ASSUMPTION]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2b9b1e241638" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"34ff020dea75">Read with abandonment</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"50c6d96798a9">
<td data-local-id=3D"9d77cacd2208" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7511ed726ad9">Searching engagement</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"67fe97f15aa0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"99a847005434">DAU, WAU and MAU of searching users (hired and=
 paused excluded); WAU =C3=B7 MAU as the core rhythm, since the digest is w=
eekly</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6f3576f30b4d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9b91f6dd3002">WAU =C3=B7 MAU =E2=89=A5 60%</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d92b0fe37b70" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"762b8454e3a2">Total MAU may fall as users get hired; that is=
 not a problem</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9001cc1dd036">
<td data-local-id=3D"f3800a75efea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a55c39306089">Retention while searching</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3f92b381ada1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c668809b8375">% of searching users still Active at week 4 an=
d week 12; hired and paused excluded</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e6e1762da1d1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ceb3817db5be">W4 =E2=89=A5 50%, W12 =E2=89=A5 35%</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d35811762a50" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"81733f544833">High retention with no hires means the search =
is not working</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4b9e09235a58">
<td data-local-id=3D"5fdc422c8e43" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fa52c78f4c83">Churn</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"725ec4a37b07" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0156b6fbf5e9">Monthly % of searching users who delete the ac=
count or turn Defunct without a hire</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4a1ee3ee6cd4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ff16aa2f1e1">=E2=89=A4 10%</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"49aa688b403f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"518e18477aa4">Ask for an exit reason; "hired" is never churn=
</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"23d8a9d8befb">
<td data-local-id=3D"fb0645946642" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"265e79753b9f">Reactivation</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a053a7202eed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7a8af09cd7d7">% of inactive or defunct users back to Active =
within 30 days of a re-onboarding nudge; returning hired users counted sepa=
rately</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"917821a2fc6b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ff8a1a94825d">=E2=89=A5 15% [TBC, cannot be fully measured i=
n the first 3 months]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1ae1f4f6f649" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55496e6feaf5">Too many nudges feel like spam</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"765dff72ad61">
<td data-local-id=3D"479ae94a2ef5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b09603584e53">Profile completeness</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"95dcb338b78d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d9f354656fa7">Mean FR17 score; % of new users reaching 90% w=
ithin 7 days (a quality signal, not a gate)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"87c95e0909f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"029492b213f8">=E2=89=A5 90% of new users reaching 90% profil=
e completeness within 7 days</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a5d452ae53a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ffd3a0ac660">Completeness is not accuracy</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"61a0e2099ae4">
<td data-local-id=3D"7937d86c8b70" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a659153af68f">Abandonment</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5375960d68b5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c7bfb2de86b">% of sign-ups who leave before the first score=
d list; % of generated documents never exported; funnel events per journey =
stage</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"554727dcec83" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1e294f30a75a">&lt; 25% before first list; &lt; 20% unexporte=
d documents</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"43c38e38af4a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0da9cf9382a2">Find the stage where users drop</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cfcd94e6abd4">
<td data-local-id=3D"2beec55bac66" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fe7f13710a99">AI cost per complete application</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8a61e772fc1d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b9fe6f4696a3">AI and infrastructure cost of Prepare, CV, cov=
er letter and interview prep for one job, from usage and billing logs; week=
ly</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dd22cb28510f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c3eb2b2f011">&lt; =E2=82=AC0.01 at scale; tracked from alph=
a</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8f200d9dfab3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"de5f0bea25ab">Regenerations and model changes shift it</p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6af2c65d919b">
<td data-local-id=3D"dd29edb38661" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8e0635ebed61">Users reaching 0 credits</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"30bf65b77476" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a01fd2da80e2">% of daily active users who use all 10 daily c=
redits, per day and per week</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c56bd081aef3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a2f7ab73c370">Baseline in beta</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3dbe88cac2a9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6d43aaba23fd">High values mean demand for paid preparation, =
or credits lost to regenerations</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a77b30c5b086">
<td data-local-id=3D"4c205f187e10" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fb3885dfcc92">Paid-credit interest</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3f41c0d5e1cb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fa783c1c04d7">Clicks on "Coming soon" in the wallet dialog =
=C3=B7 users who reached 0 credits</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1dc0c8fea6ac" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"935cf2aa7ea4">=E2=89=A5 20%</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c82caf4b18f8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7dd45874c00f">A fake-door signal, not a purchase</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"6bd167f34e67" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Headhuntergo=
alsandpilotmetrics">Headhunter goals and pilot metrics</h3>
<p local-id=3D"8b17e6f3ad24">BG5: validate whether explained =E2=89=A590% J=
D-to-profile matching and immediate availability reduce manual sourcing whi=
le protecting candidate choice. Sofia=E2=80=99s goal: review qualified, ava=
ilable candidates for a confirmed JD without searching CV databases.</p>
<p local-id=3D"fa8113e9bc92">The candidate metrics above are the revised se=
t. Only the user-set minimum fit (default 90%) is a confirmed stakeholder t=
hreshold; all other targets remain [ASSUMPTION] until the four-week beta ba=
seline. Pilot costs are measured separately.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"7=
edcb934-9e21-4cff-8abf-2e67078d763d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b57cc56a-d180-4957-8ad4-9d8cb716248c">
<th data-local-id=3D"75f2e340-83f3-4c2f-b234-35e7b6eb8e1d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"44e0047e3e8d">Pilot metric</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"28907f4c-8b06-4215-9537-6ecc71c4405f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ba6e2961ef3e">Definition</p></th>
