<p local-id=3D"fde5073eb521">Pilot targets are not permission to inflate sc=
ores or guarantee matches. Report eligible supply, zero-match rate and cand=
idate and recruiter cohorts separately. Jobs below a user's minimum fit sta=
y visible to that user, labelled "Below your minimum fit"; candidates below=
 90% are never headhunter shortlist entries.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"388387341e99" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-5.Requiremen=
ts">5. Requirements</h2>
<p local-id=3D"f24ac4f9b3db">The Must requirements define the MVP: aggregat=
ed discovery, explainable matching with completeness-based confidence, revi=
ewed document generation and tracking, on neutral ranking and GDPR-grade pr=
ivacy.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d028c2ddd43e">With 2 engineers, 1 ML engineer and a fixed de=
adline, Should items are stretch goals for sprints 13=E2=80=9314; any not d=
one by G3 move to the first post-launch release [ASSUMPTION].</p>
