<p local-id=3D"9e4a7dbd0973">Proposed score model, with weights to be defin=
ed and published in FR19:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Match =
=3D =CE=A3 w_i =C2=B7 s_i,  with =CE=A3 w_i =3D 1</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"ac6e3918a5e1">Here s is the fit (0=E2=80=931) per criterion:=
 skills, experience and seniority, domain, languages, location, education. =
An unmet must-have requirement caps the score and appears under risks.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"40339dc393ea" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-RICEprioriti=
sation">RICE prioritisation</h3>
<p local-id=3D"eff9704b5e90"><strong>RICE =3D Reach =C3=97 Impact =C3=97 Co=
nfidence =C3=B7 Effort. </strong>Reach: users touched per quarter, out of a=
 beta of about 500 candidates (headhunter items count pilot recruiters or o=
pted-in candidates). Impact: 3 massive, 2 high, 1 medium, 0.5 low. Confiden=
ce: 100%, 80% or 50%. Effort: person-weeks for the team of 2 engineers and =
1 ML engineer. All values are [ASSUMPTION] estimates for ranking, not commi=
tments; legal and trust requirements are marked Mandatory and are not ranke=
d.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b44e28d0d5cd"><strong>What it shows: </strong>FR18 (matching=
 without a gate, 800), FR4, FR19 and FR23 deliver the most value per week. =
If G3 slips, cut in this order: FR21 profiling interview (18.8), FR13 inter=
view assistant (37.5, kept as a demo screen), FR15 guidance (41.7), FR3 mul=
tilingual merge (16.7, stays Should). FR12 reminders are cheap (120) and st=
ay. FR20 confidence (266.7) now replaces the completeness gate, so it moves=
 from Should to Must (+1.5 pw in Must scope). Headhunter items score low on=
 RICE because their reach is a handful of pilot recruiters; they stay condi=
tional pilot Musts placed by value vs effort and gated by the release gates=
.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"c20763766d5e" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Prioritisati=
ontrade-offs">Prioritisation trade-offs</h3>
<p local-id=3D"dad23a7c5877">RICE ranks features by value per week, but som=
e choices were made on principle, not score. Each one buys something and co=
sts something:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"c=
32706d66384" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"410d0effe199">
<th data-local-id=3D"ead1c1835605" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"1ccd518f6c56">Decision</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"527286cc3ee9" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c01bc8b029d5">What we gain</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b9e3ebf9fddc" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2475145aef9c">What we give up</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b56241ef797f">
<td data-local-id=3D"b8799a5bfba9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74ef24c4ae47">No completeness gate</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"067aa0e1a00a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"36e084c09f9e">Everyone sees jobs right away; FR20 confidence=
 tells users how much to trust each score</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"53f1ef731128" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e4090d6cd65e">Some scores show with low confidence until the=
 profile fills in</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ebd5954af1c6">
<td data-local-id=3D"7abd494e46b0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"24acec1e296d">FR20 confidence moved to Must</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5f033dc33e2b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"79aa5c90066a">Replaces the gate as the honesty mechanism</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7788395f59b8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0bf76906ccae">Adds 1.5 pw to the Must scope</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7256ff44021f">
<td data-local-id=3D"cb5424b54df6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d8d47bbf62f">Public job lists only</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"98d5cb45a509" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9b4c97bfa8b4">Legal, no scraping risk</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9dfeabc6afb3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d8fce9f0d283">Possibly too few relevant jobs; checked at G1<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e6ca0d57088a">
<td data-local-id=3D"b3716a1b0ef3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e2f0400572b4">Free fit score for every job</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3569ce2a7939" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"026b35f3d95c">Trust; no paywall on judging fit</p></td>
