<h3 local-id=3D"e44e56e96a6c" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Edgecasesand=
errorhandling">Edge cases and error handling</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"c=
7011dac4137" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5d94583d97d5">
<th data-local-id=3D"7075c233bd90" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9b7ad1a85b93">Case</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"57bc17e466b9" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4bb0f5c9b337">Expected behaviour</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"aecd0997c361" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ee9ca737ba84">Related</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"21579f453120">
<td data-local-id=3D"a7b2c665eb7b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"756d48cf173e">CV cannot be parsed (scanned image, unusual la=
yout)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d752059cfd8b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c1271f6f84f0">Try OCR; otherwise open a pre-structured manua=
l form and show which sections failed</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"859413b2ea32" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"874cb0fed933">FR2</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"464c74c570d3">
<td data-local-id=3D"48773e64bb10" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"189860d9b2c6">Profile incomplete</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"52f56c301508" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"31ea0691c228">Show scores with a lower confidence label and =
a prompt naming the missing fields that would improve accuracy; offer the p=
rofiling interview</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8f3a151d3107" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4a7e2605bb2b">FR18, FR21</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3f42c392786c">
<td data-local-id=3D"867b1a3503ba" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96cbe223f70c">Job ad has too little information to score</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d3685d763a3b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"20da2c6021d9">Show the job with a low-confidence label, or "=
Not enough data to score" below a minimum</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"458b4fb1a233" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"59549e373a04">FR20</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5ea8bfd2c895">
<td data-local-id=3D"9365af649c85" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"39da588ed2a7">Ad in an unsupported language</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"41687c0e973b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dea50f2ceb2b">List the job, mark "Language not supported for=
 matching", disable document generation</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e50e6fa840ab" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b1a5b7622df6">NFR5</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"862338f1fc5e">
<td data-local-id=3D"feddf8268026" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dfe2c7aa29eb">Same job listed more than once with different =
details</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f65128f41896" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f595d4631183">Merge into one card, list all sources, use the=
 most recent version</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9bd105a2e842" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"67cb74fa80d7">FR5</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"de1c8b770972">
<td data-local-id=3D"2f8ff2611fe4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0201d9e967a0">Job expired or removed at source</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3e686cc2bc56" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3e8d7eff24ee">Mark "Expired" in the digest and disable Apply=
; the application history keeps the saved job description</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c610eea659cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e021918ce04">FR5, FR11</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d1c0da8456a2">
<td data-local-id=3D"18d488567342" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"250e8733fa20">A job board source is unavailable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ddad909bea22" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"212dba2662bd">Send the digest with the remaining sources, na=
me the missing one, retry next cycle</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f6558dbf13f9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b93cc423b4bd">FR6</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4bb59a5e6896">
<td data-local-id=3D"8f852390e6df" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"43c3bfcea27b">Generated document states something not in the=
 profile</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e6da60656116" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"00c13a318889">Flag the unsupported statement; block export u=
ntil the user accepts or removes it</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2854b38bd3d2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1203cdd608cf">FR9, FR10</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cf790b37fa0b">
<td data-local-id=3D"7095e88a3b6b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ed0f37ce01c3">User rejects all suggested changes</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"101772e477b8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e31e4131bdf9">Export the original CV unchanged</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5d56c7d65099" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c26705e8b3e8">FR10</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4e5d7dd14710">
<td data-local-id=3D"9c7838d8c3af" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"340abbe7cc7a">CV versions contradict each other (dates, titl=
es)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6fbb9aeee0cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"167053759828">Flag the conflict and ask the user which is co=
rrect</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"02cdff5e0bd4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ac0a3c42338">FR3</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d0c687bc8cd7">
<td data-local-id=3D"35b359efff74" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f93ba572d2e">Recruiter asks for ID or bank details</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3f1c7ce2a74f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a11d06038742">Post-MVP with employer login: show a warning a=
nd a "report" option</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"85177b577bc7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"015a84b1adc3">FR14 (post-MVP)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f47afe9078e2">
<td data-local-id=3D"568c2ed75cac" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"98996d80bd8d">User applies to the same job twice</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"137cac96c37c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"57fc2b3d47f5">Warn and show the existing application history=
 entry</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cbd16434289d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"22543b130bef">FR11</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b0c1c1471e93">
<td data-local-id=3D"ae997e8e2843" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"660d352986f6">Filters return zero matches</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fcebf64f2b43" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"04e68f74159d">Suggest which filter to loosen; show near miss=
es</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"520366e6290a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"82c376220510">FR4, FR16</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"be56ff85ab92">
<td data-local-id=3D"52aabe08b94b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9bf44527eed4">User deletes the account</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a8352a18c1e9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0b787933bdf4">Delete all personal data within 30 days and co=
nfirm by email [ASSUMPTION]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0be4448f5d07" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5140a78a8852">NFR2</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f573087cbfc2">
<td data-local-id=3D"7899613ab299" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fd3c66036508">User has used all 10 daily credits</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"273ef56e9e72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7cf638de2237">Disable paid steps, keep scores, why it fits a=
nd saving available, show when the limit resets and show pay as you apply a=
s "Coming soon"</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e325c156ac04" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6158074f9dba">FR22</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8e6e5c79d259">
<td data-local-id=3D"ce35b061938f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ba36106f707">User wants interview prep before applying</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ffcf232fb997" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4f19d657c20e">Not offered on the job; Prepare for interview =
appears on the application once the user confirms "Did you apply?"</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"81d6f41b205d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9f47f0559dc2">FR11, FR13</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
