nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1f76e196806c">Pilot onboarding prohibits such requests; cand=
idate can report/block the recruiter and admin can suspend access. Broad FR=
14 trust indicator remains post-MVP.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e10196bb-bd5f-4e4b-afad-6e312ad4b3d4" class=3D"conflue=
