<h2 local-id=3D"7bc0beaf73c2" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-6.UserStorie=
s">6. User Stories</h2>
<p local-id=3D"b4030d93763b">The seven core stories cover discover, evaluat=
e, apply and track. The full Jira backlog (CPA) now contains 29 user storie=
s: the existing 22 plus US23=E2=80=93US29 for the controlled headhunter pil=
ot, detailed below.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"c=
7086ac8b696" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c2bdda370bab">
<th data-local-id=3D"cbe94b439243" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d689676941c3">ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"67879a327c82" class=3D"confluenceTh">
