<h3 local-id=3D"384842884c95" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Acceptancecr=
iteria">Acceptance criteria</h3>
<p local-id=3D"9fb86b769705"><strong>US1</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"5d59cfc1b6bb">
<li local-id=3D"f6c0cffc13b3">
<p local-id=3D"a92840df8fbd">Filters saved once apply to every connected so=
urce.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4b096e42f626">
<p local-id=3D"a60244b302a0">The digest arrives at the user-set day and tim=
e, the same time for every user, whether or not they bought credits.</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"547074dd1eb1">
<p local-id=3D"5e7c1a565180">A job listed more than once appears once, with=
 every source listed.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4956c3d5c6f7">
<p local-id=3D"882e09f16113">Only jobs at or above the user's minimum match=
 appear first; if fewer than 10 qualify, the list is filled up to 10 with t=
he best remaining jobs, labelled "Below your minimum fit".</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"3ab9071532f2"><strong>US2</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"016f122b47a4">
<li local-id=3D"0affbe796c86">
<p local-id=3D"b4030513b60f">Every score shows "Why it fits" in a few words=
, positives only, with its confidence label.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6237b36c9a30">
<p local-id=3D"6b6c7ed78a52">Prepare application shows the four evidence gr=
oups (strengths, gaps, transferables, risks), each point linked to the matc=
hing passage in the CV and the ad.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a3735e7991b1">
<p local-id=3D"edd6ba5a56c2">"How this score is calculated" lists each crit=
erion, its weight and its contribution, and the contributions add up to the=
 score.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"22bc7049560c">
<p local-id=3D"a6cd55493c59">No job carries a sponsored label or a paid ran=
king boost.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"aa87080e5349"><strong>US3</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d0434d85676e">
<li local-id=3D"665824d15867">
<p local-id=3D"704e72164c3e">The dashboard shows the completeness score and=
 the missing fields.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f381805a9da5">
<p local-id=3D"bf5c88e40743">With an incomplete profile, jobs still show a =
score with its confidence label and "Complete your profile to improve accur=
acy".</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c9eebb4484f9">
<p local-id=3D"e10129f7af99">A score under 70% states its main cause: fit g=
ap or missing data. It is not a recommendation eligibility threshold.</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"833d29300b93">
<p local-id=3D"bfdeb46c5b2d">Internships and thesis projects that match ad =
requirements appear under transferables.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"5e59c7cc54e3"><strong>US4</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"8285d8437631">
<li local-id=3D"6ee326411f85">
<p local-id=3D"05008fdd8662">Confirming "Did you apply?" after Apply on job=
 site creates an entry with date, source, language, document version and th=
e saved job description.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ba9cdc54a614">
<p local-id=3D"f5ccba61c5eb">Status changes take at most two clicks.</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"9ceedf1dd72e">
<p local-id=3D"6f8538455900">Opening a job already in the application histo=
ry shows a duplicate warning.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"357499b63f0b"><strong>US5</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"332678f26858">
<li local-id=3D"df0df249d005">
<p local-id=3D"594dca98d4a5">Documents are generated in the ad's language (=
German or English).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"34d371d66fd2">
<p local-id=3D"f0eb7af4324f">A diff view shows every change against the bas=
e CV; each change can be accepted, rejected or edited.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a64f700eb119">
<p local-id=3D"3c440d7ec62e">Statements not supported by the profile are fl=
agged and block export until resolved.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7c5e9862cae4">
<p local-id=3D"e374a328f290">Export is available as PDF and DOCX.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"8604b48da5e7"><strong>US6</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e488c395d7fe">
<li local-id=3D"4f64b22b1078">
<p local-id=3D"471993aa4e77">The required language and level are extracted =
and shown on the job card.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"55f44188bd88">
<p local-id=3D"74a315805df5">If the profile level is lower, the gap appears=
 under risks and caps the score.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"30c7fbe3f2d7">
<p local-id=3D"7b1bd2aeda31">If the ad states no level, the language criter=
ion shows low confidence.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0107b8eadfd9"><strong>US7</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"84c7a66ee45d">
<li local-id=3D"2e3b9170d0b9">
<p local-id=3D"614fcb19e1c5">The interview can be started from the complete=
ness prompt.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"13634d612d06">
<p local-id=3D"033ee6df4f87">It takes at most 15 minutes [ASSUMPTION].</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"f74797c5e7b7">
<p local-id=3D"6bf4c11a1ea9">Answers become suggested profile additions tha=
t the user accepts or rejects.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f7167d91bdfb">
<p local-id=3D"b64d679c9916">Completeness is recalculated right after the i=
nterview.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c30fd9f63d89" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Headhunterpi=
lotEpicsandbacklog">Headhunter pilot Epics and backlog</h3>
<p local-id=3D"bb5791ab9bfb"><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://glo=
goveanu.atlassian.net/browse/CPA-88" rel=3D"nofollow">CPA-88</a> =E2=80=94 =
Headhunter Matching &amp; Outreach: US23, US24, US27, US28 and US29. <a cla=
ss=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/browse/CPA-89=
" rel=3D"nofollow">CPA-89</a> =E2=80=94 Candidate Discovery Consent &amp; A=
vailability: US25 and US26. All new work remains unscheduled pending capaci=
ty review; the seven existing Epics and their children retain their hierarc=
hy.</p>
