nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b92a453d4758">As a headhunter, I want a shortlist of availab=
le candidates with at least 90% CV=E2=80=93JD fit and linked evidence, so t=
hat I can focus on qualified profiles without manual CV searching.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4b7139b5-6c8e-47e5-8085-5ed5bfc28fe6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d95699d64949">Sofia</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2aee6395-ffcd-46d7-a177-5657badc8e4f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58c13db89173">Must (pilot)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"20b33cdc-2bec-4b74-8226-e4b95aa0889d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"42e0e48b4fa6">FR29, FR7, FR17, FR18, FR19; parent CPA-88</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4237a3fd-5a01-415f-a2a7-e54e98069ff3">
<td data-local-id=3D"4d907550-7c18-41bc-afc9-1695f2bff9b2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"15d750691c9a">US28 / CPA-95</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"470f7b28-1516-4d1c-967f-d6622511acba" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7809971655ac">As a headhunter, I want to request access to a=
 matched candidate=E2=80=99s CV for a named role, so that I can contact the=
m with their approval.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3dbfc77f-7a78-4cb5-8e6f-bc7edd69f110" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"43efa070e658">Sofia</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2af53c08-2d2d-478f-99d0-dd4a017df5c4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d9de6575dc87">Must (pilot)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8ef96574-0094-4a87-a11c-7735ab4ad1b3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"457660a7946a">FR30, NFR12; parent CPA-88</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"33e662e5-f960-46dc-bc63-f86e100d94d5">
<td data-local-id=3D"e318b687-25ed-46e5-a1b7-eb0d0fbfe6da" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a11a86eb5d80">US29 / CPA-96</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"16415447-dd5d-4da5-9ce2-665625812a86" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"045244c7d34c">As a headhunter, I want to track candidate req=
uests and responses for each JD, so that I avoid duplicate outreach and mea=
sure sourcing quality.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ed9013bd-36ef-4f52-b57f-e13bb4634403" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fceaaab98222">Sofia</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6a8c1d9f-db73-4e1d-9138-ec8550d59a3b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bf62b2f641e8">Should (pilot)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4ca7adb6-6297-461d-a030-6b1c03172c37" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b6db9eeee0db">FR31; parent CPA-88</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"2f06a75471a3" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Headhunterac=
ceptancecriteria">Headhunter acceptance criteria</h3>
<p local-id=3D"5e5d1974822f"><strong>US23 =E2=80=94 </strong><a class=3D"ex=
ternal-link" href=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/browse/CPA-90" rel=3D=
"nofollow"><strong>CPA-90</strong></a><strong> =E2=80=94 Verified headhunte=
r workspace</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"5fd30b03-e5da-44a2-939f-3ba92a9fd725">
<li local-id=3D"81181ad3-ac52-48f1-a5df-9328eb7950a2">
<p local-id=3D"b4d552cf70e7">Unverified accounts cannot view candidate prof=
iles or contact candidates.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1ce99e26-7ad7-4c5c-a5c1-86995f969312">
<p local-id=3D"d1f98918e692">An admin verifies recruiter identity, organisa=
tion/domain and authority to recruit; no document access is granted merely =
by SSO.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7c9989ee-a3d4-4995-9e14-ca40091ba388">
<p local-id=3D"01de29508f73">Every JD, shortlist and request is isolated by=
 recruiter organisation; cross-organisation access is denied and audited.</=
p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e8debc9d13b0"><strong>US24 =E2=80=94 </strong><a class=3D"ex=
ternal-link" href=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/browse/CPA-91" rel=3D=
"nofollow"><strong>CPA-91</strong></a><strong> =E2=80=94 Submit and confirm=
 a structured JD</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e94c20a4-cd31-4814-a39e-a047f6f5c7a6">
<li local-id=3D"b5e46f8c-f5bd-4492-9163-028adaf4316e">
<p local-id=3D"384da4f41098">A German/English JD captures skills, experienc=
e, seniority, location/remote policy, language requirements and desired sta=
rt date.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"58a85221-be21-4a51-8e0b-a1cdc12ae624">
<p local-id=3D"ab2cd1fcde96">Extracted criteria and must-haves require recr=
uiter confirmation; unsupported or insufficient JDs cannot generate a short=
list.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5d0064df-209a-45f8-8a72-8a23c4bbb6a7">
<p local-id=3D"dd24b4248845">The recruiter confirms authority to use the JD=
; each edit creates a new version and invalidates prior match results.</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"78b1d48313d3"><strong>US25 =E2=80=94 </strong><a class=3D"ex=
ternal-link" href=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/browse/CPA-92" rel=3D=
"nofollow"><strong>CPA-92</strong></a><strong> =E2=80=94 Opt in to headhunt=
er discovery and revoke access</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"2da6eb47-93ab-436f-b326-299ca30672a2">
<li local-id=3D"2baec64c-6ccb-4772-87b7-d3cc7a94c78f">
<p local-id=3D"a0c83a150ae9">Discovery is off by default and independent of=
 job-seeker credits or ranking; explicit consent records scope, time and po=
licy version.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2080ffeb-b2e8-4e09-9eae-5dd8178d223f">
<p local-id=3D"ec6ace66163a">Candidates preview the discoverable fields; ra=
w CV, contact details and application history are excluded from initial sho=
rtlists.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e7d9d3d-eb94-4f81-8665-e7255c400d3e">
<p local-id=3D"c9c6b0243b78">Turning discovery off prevents subsequent sear=
ches and access immediately, invalidates cached previews and active share l=
inks, and creates an audit event.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"62f80c4a4e8e"><strong>US26 =E2=80=94 </strong><a class=3D"ex=
ternal-link" href=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/browse/CPA-93" rel=3D=
"nofollow"><strong>CPA-93</strong></a><strong> =E2=80=94 Declare and refres=
h immediate availability</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"f908ce49-59d0-4db2-92b2-ce03ac28c5b3">
<li local-id=3D"b4047cf8-cceb-4231-9077-7accb806885d">
<p local-id=3D"10fd4cf64ebf">Store candidate-declared earliest start date, =
availability status and last-confirmed timestamp; never infer availability =
from profile or application history.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"239a259a-776b-42f7-91e3-727afa5f0954">
<p local-id=3D"2519f8b47016">Immediately available means the candidate expl=
icitly confirms they can start now and are open to recruiter contact; last =
confirmation must be within 7 days [ASSUMPTION].</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fec3cadc-222d-4e16-a8c5-41cbe80b43ea">
<p local-id=3D"be7e3b95f572">Future start dates, stale, unknown or withdraw=
n availability exclude the candidate from immediate-availability shortlists=
; changes trigger invalidation and a fresh eligibility check.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"54c1613d5ee5"><strong>US27 =E2=80=94 </strong><a class=3D"ex=
ternal-link" href=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/browse/CPA-94" rel=3D=
"nofollow"><strong>CPA-94</strong></a><strong> =E2=80=94 Receive explained =
=E2=89=A590% available-candidate shortlists</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"ac2ca8ba-2677-4663-b9ed-d2d93ce22169">
<li local-id=3D"04185772-b1a1-468b-a011-a2359b29fd51">
<p local-id=3D"5a1b4537f9e9">Only verified recruiters and opted-in candidat=
es are eligible; profile completeness and the unrounded CV=E2=80=93JD match=
 score must each be =E2=89=A590%.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"543408ef-8c84-4424-98c6-36b577b24995">
<p local-id=3D"3a37e124a9f8">Confirmed must-haves must be met; score confid=
ence must be high, and immediate availability must be fresh under FR28. A 8=
9.9% score, unresolved must-have or unknown availability is excluded.</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"343a110d-d10d-4a22-824f-bb0e8be64fe6">
<p local-id=3D"455ffa75c12f">Each entry shows score, criteria, weights, str=
engths, gaps, transferables, risks and availability timestamp; evidence use=
s only candidate-approved discoverable fields.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8a6b8272-4017-45d0-96bd-920a64f6c5a5">
<p local-id=3D"bf3bcc5f2005">Fit, completeness, confidence and availability=
 appear separately; availability, payment and sensitive or protected attrib=
utes never boost fit scores.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6445c791-b38e-4d19-914f-239dfe097ee4">
<p local-id=3D"dd3372734be8">No qualifying candidate produces an honest emp=
ty state; never lower 90% automatically. Recheck eligibility after JD/profi=
le/consent/availability changes.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"7435cfadae79"><strong>US28 =E2=80=94 </strong><a class=3D"ex=
ternal-link" href=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/browse/CPA-95" rel=3D=
"nofollow"><strong>CPA-95</strong></a><strong> =E2=80=94 Request candidate-=
approved CV access</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"4b63e8cd-667a-4885-9415-ddc25d04c299">
<li local-id=3D"ce5cb410-3ab8-4351-8303-3a24d98e0fe9">
<p local-id=3D"d8013a44e65f">A request identifies verified recruiter/organi=
sation, JD version and purpose; candidate can approve or decline without lo=
sing ranking or credits.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0afa3409-d458-4338-b8b0-d6e9a6e18c8c">
<p local-id=3D"4453ddf2ad63">CV and contact details remain hidden until the=
 candidate approves that recruiter and role and selects a specific CV versi=
on.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8647587d-c76f-4b73-a3c7-789c73e8e0ae">
<p local-id=3D"908fe4e00705">Approval creates scoped, expiring access for t=
hat recruiter and JD (7-day expiry [ASSUMPTION]); every view is logged; rev=
ocation blocks further access immediately.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2f049a70-56f9-46f0-8c3a-60689907dc1b">
<p local-id=3D"bacfea32f76e">No automatic CV distribution, bulk export, thi=
rd-party onward sharing, automatic rejection or hiring decision is performe=
d; recipients are told downloaded copies cannot be technically recalled.</p=
></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"da62ab36d74d"><strong>US29 =E2=80=94 </strong><a class=3D"ex=
ternal-link" href=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/browse/CPA-96" rel=3D=
"nofollow"><strong>CPA-96</strong></a><strong> =E2=80=94 Track shortlist ou=
treach and outcomes</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"7eb009b9-89af-45cc-b2b6-247d0611c1e6">
<li local-id=3D"9bdf0c5b-7c10-48d1-a8e0-e6b6250b1b1d">
<p local-id=3D"34454f3c6101">Track requested, accepted, declined, expired a=
nd withdrawn states with timestamp and JD version.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3e6a6cd1-bab1-4bc1-a7bb-d3977a29d6b5">
<p local-id=3D"c5cf4645b3f5">A duplicate request for the same candidate and=
 active JD is blocked; after decline or withdrawal, further requests requir=
e a new candidate opt-in.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"44dd21ee-e104-409e-bf0a-c6b432c6253f">
<p local-id=3D"c01710254eb4">Pilot analytics record shortlist eligibility, =
response rate, time to shortlist and cost without exposing candidate applic=
ation history; no outreach event creates a candidate application automatica=
lly.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"6bfc52858e9f" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Prioritisati=
onreview:MoSCoWandvaluevseffort">Prioritisation review: MoSCoW and value vs=
 effort</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f8495615adbb">MoSCoW: US23=E2=80=93US28 are Must for the con=
trolled pilot; US29 is Should and can follow the pilot without weakening ac=
cess controls. These are conditional pilot Musts, not automatic additions t=
o the fixed candidate-MVP sprint commitments. Consent, verified access and =
availability cannot be cut to accelerate the pilot.</p>
<p>Value vs effort: value is the business value of each story, effort its r=
elative size, both on a common 1/2/3/5 scale. High value is 5; high effort =
is 3 or more. Estimates are [ASSUMPTION], to be reviewed with engineering a=
nd pilot interviews; they are not measured outcomes or committed story poin=
ts.</p>
