<p local-id=3D"68c15551b882">Dependency-adjusted order: US25 =E2=86=92 US26=
; US23 =E2=86=92 US24; both branches =E2=86=92 US27 =E2=86=92 US28 =E2=86=
=92 optional US29. US29=E2=80=99s quadrant does not override its prerequisi=
tes or Should status. Reuse CPA-2 profile capabilities, CPA-4 scoring/expla=
nations and CPA-8 data rights; do not duplicate or reparent their existing =
stories.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"491ea0d882ea" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-7.DesignCons=
iderations">7. Design Considerations</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"7fe159ef4bed" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Principles">=
Principles</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"91c8cb8649b9">
<li local-id=3D"3a108fe59b33">
<p local-id=3D"f07fe05888e8"><strong>Explained, never bare:</strong> the sc=
ore always comes with why it fits and how it is calculated; the full eviden=
ce is one click away in Prepare (NFR3).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7c8d34696c0b">
<p local-id=3D"d89777960402"><strong>User stays in control:</strong> AI pro=
poses, the user approves; nothing is sent or exported without review (FR10)=
.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aa367a5f17ce">
<p local-id=3D"941a07887ffc"><strong>Honest about missing data:</strong> an=
 incomplete profile gets a prompt, not a misleading low score (FR18).</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"8e018a32f6c1">
<p local-id=3D"ce2d35543251"><strong>Neutral by design:</strong> no sponsor=
ed slots, badges or premium-only timing anywhere in the candidate UI (NFR1)=
.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c95d9a1055ed">
<p local-id=3D"da1038c02778"><strong>One place for everything:</strong> one=
 digest, one application history, one profile across languages (FR3, FR5, F=
R11).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d9dfdf661949">
<p local-id=3D"055d115acb45"><strong>Calm, not noisy:</strong> fewer, bette=
r suggestions on the user's schedule instead of real-time alerts (FR6).</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"3829cb48852d">
<p local-id=3D"efbdfb2920e0"><strong>Honest pricing:</strong> free actions =
stay free, and every paid step shows its credit cost before the click (FR22=
).</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"ae9c88cd90f4" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Keyuserflows=
">Key user flows</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c7eb2913fb1c"><strong>Flow A: onboarding to first scored mat=
ch</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"804153d3edfa">
<li local-id=3D"601c511d9c75">
<p local-id=3D"6e604becd01b">Sign in with SSO</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c8ce5a877e31">
<p local-id=3D"c13f1bc7b515">Upload CV</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e670982c9552">
<p local-id=3D"9659c95863c3">Set preferences</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"923b9b4741f2">
<p local-id=3D"afce49f2e003">First scored digest: at least the 10 best-fitt=
ing jobs, each with score, confidence and why it fits</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2ccc2e488159">
<p local-id=3D"54cb0c4e7e5f">If the profile is incomplete: confidence is lo=
wer, missing fields are shown and the profiling interview is offered; score=
s update as fields are added</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"76da138b9ab7"><strong>Flow B: evaluate and apply</strong></p=
>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"ca3ca41ac226">
<li local-id=3D"5d9afcebb558">
<p local-id=3D"576f4825b896">Open a job from the digest: score, confidence =
and why it fits (free).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cb8b81487687">
<p local-id=3D"a4bcab6e1fd8">Optionally open "How this score is calculated"=
 (free).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3f065e272927">
<p local-id=3D"973ce4cde7a5">Choose one of three actions: Prepare applicati=
on (1 credit), Apply on job site (free) or Save (free).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f1e932d867b1">
<p local-id=3D"012a3967f98b">Prepare: read the full evidence, then confirm =
or edit the AI strategy.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"be29cfe59ac5">
<p local-id=3D"2946e078959d">Generate a CV and/or cover letter (1 credit ea=
ch); review each change in a diff view; resolve flagged statements; export =
PDF or DOCX.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a014619efde5">
<p local-id=3D"a4edd09404a1">Apply on job site; on return, "Did you apply?"=
 Yes creates the application history entry with the saved job description.<=
/p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"982fc4ffc6fc"><strong>Flow C: application history, follow-up=
 and interview prep</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"afca38d05233">
<li local-id=3D"0cff3fa318de">
<p local-id=3D"7a60b233dd84">The application history lists all applications=
 by status, date, source and language.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d67a2d82aebf">
<p local-id=3D"eb740db0afe8">Opening an application shows the saved job des=
cription and offers Prepare for interview (1 credit).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e306cd925c5c">
<p local-id=3D"8661836caeb2">A reminder appears when no status change has h=
appened for 10 days [ASSUMPTION].</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"5b48222b138b" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Constraints"=
>Constraints</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"97b344ff990a">
<li local-id=3D"66f2afdcc44f">
<p local-id=3D"30d9b0f3cbf7">MVP is a responsive web app; no native mobile =
apps [ASSUMPTION]. The prototype shows desktop frames and one mobile frame =
of the job focus.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d13f2a0a111a">
<p local-id=3D"9bbfa989ad4b">UI and generated content in German and English=
 (NFR5).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0b1cc5967e81">
<p local-id=3D"5d64dc9103bb">Users apply on the employer's own portal; Care=
erPilot does not submit applications in MVP (see Out of Scope), and paid st=
eps use daily credits (FR22).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"38874ba2eabc">
<p local-id=3D"780720d71fe4">All copy about free and paid features must be =
visible before sign-up (NFR6).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"91ead8742bf8">
<p local-id=3D"7229003c6fe8">Accessibility to WCAG 2.1 AA (NFR10).</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c2e74539c212" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Headhunterfl=
owanddesignconstraints">Headhunter flow and design constraints</h3>
<p local-id=3D"772dcabbabd2">Flow D: recruiter SSO =E2=86=92 verified works=
pace =E2=86=92 JD confirmation =E2=86=92 eligible shortlist =E2=86=92 inspe=
ct permitted evidence =E2=86=92 role-specific CV request =E2=86=92 candidat=
e approval/decline =E2=86=92 expiring CV access =E2=86=92 request outcome. =
Flow E: candidate discovers opt-in controls =E2=86=92 previews shared field=
s =E2=86=92 declares start date/availability =E2=86=92 periodically reconfi=
rms =E2=86=92 can revoke discovery or CV access at any time.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5b0dcce8c83c">Show fit, completeness, confidence and availab=
ility as separate indicators. Initial shortlist cards exclude raw CVs and d=
irect contact details; score evidence must be supported by candidate-approv=
ed fields. =E2=80=9CNo eligible candidates=E2=80=9D is a valid result. Neve=
r lower 90% silently or describe a model score as a hiring guarantee. Manua=
l individual candidate evaluation and optional near misses remain separate =
from headhunter recommendations.</p>
<p local-id=3D"17fa5f06e3fb">The candidate=E2=80=99s four-step application =
flow and credit charges stay unchanged. Headhunter permitted evidence is in=
cluded in pilot review, not unlocked by spending the candidate=E2=80=99s Pr=
epare credit. Candidate-controlled sharing is a distinct action from candid=
ate PDF/DOCX export. Pilot pricing and recruiter quotas require a separate =
decision.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"c03e9ccfa207" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-8.TechnicalC=
onsiderations">8. Technical Considerations</h2>
<p local-id=3D"5f4df57a75fa">No architecture exists yet; this section lists=
 the capabilities the MVP needs and the questions engineering must answer, =
not a design.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"d77ea848e6d4" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Requiredcapa=
bilities">Required capabilities</h3>
