<td data-local-id=3D"0f0eff85ba57" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b558cb58f7c8">Rules, embeddings, LLM or a mix? How are weigh=
ts set and validated? How is each evidence point linked to a text span?</p>=
</td>
</tr>
