<td data-local-id=3D"092ca3994675" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5adc294cd4d5">FR17, FR18</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cc511b74a45c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f702e54e26c">Which fields carry which weights in the comple=
teness score, and how does completeness map to the confidence label (FR20)?=
