<h3 local-id=3D"3fa929da0f9f" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Cross-cuttin=
gquestions">Cross-cutting questions</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"98d5a4a6af33">
<li local-id=3D"128e37668722">
<p local-id=3D"5ea6304e3d3a"><strong>Model hosting and cost:</strong> can a=
ll LLM processing stay in the EU, and can a complete application (4 credits=
) stay under =E2=82=AC0.01 at scale, and what does the free scoring of ever=
y digest job cost?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"26507b05b785">
<p local-id=3D"2be1295b2fc1"><strong>Scoring validation:</strong> which lab=
elled dataset of profiles, jobs and outcomes proves the score is accurate b=
efore launch?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6974ffd01d89">
<p local-id=3D"6df1ba33f164"><strong>Bias and fairness:</strong> how do we =
test that scores do not disadvantage by age, gender or origin?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d4881d35630d">
<p local-id=3D"ab6b6387278c"><strong>Regulation:</strong> does the EU AI Ac=
t treat AI used in employment as high-risk, and does that apply to a candid=
ate-side tool or only to the post-MVP employer search? Needs legal review [=
ASSUMPTION: applicability unconfirmed].</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cedd5f79af20">
<p local-id=3D"279ba5483a51"><strong>Neutrality by design:</strong> how do =
we enforce in code that no commercial signal can enter ranking or notificat=
ion timing (NFR1)?</p></li>
</ul>
