<td data-local-id=3D"9b762353-9745-457c-b150-68079708a3c8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4128bfee0c8c">Reuse extraction; require explicit must-have c=
onfirmation and invalidate scores on edit.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ffc551ed-5374-4a5c-8069-9d05b4b78c76">
<td data-local-id=3D"1d2a493d-d98b-453c-a472-d1cdc3ca6218" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f6908f686738">Discovery consent and availability schema</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c2fb30b2-487d-490a-b518-bfd05f61a380" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d72c604a3379">FR27, FR28</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"70436097-f0aa-4410-9410-5803caca44d0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2aa22e855fbb">Separate opt-in, permitted fields, earliest st=
art, confirmed-at and expiry; implement missing/stale/withdrawn states.</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3b813791-d52a-46bb-90a3-10b79701626d">
<td data-local-id=3D"4117193d-0f1a-48ab-9e9a-4d1cb29ebd15" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b27bf12ef965">Candidate shortlist retrieval and scoring</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7e24abdf-3db7-4171-a8a4-a7b94ca31c14" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ce96340740a5">FR29, NFR13</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"01d7cadc-6882-44ca-a54f-be5a4431fcea" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ceb4912f297b">Reuse explainable engine; full criteria/eviden=
ce and high-confidence checks. Match unrounded score =E2=89=A590% after com=
pleteness =E2=89=A590%; apply availability as a filter.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"132b399d-8c5b-4f60-9237-8b1c3d48a355">
<td data-local-id=3D"4205df0e-fade-46ba-9780-f39472e87772" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bd28459e940a">Scoped CV access and revocation</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c4f4775b-f16a-4ef8-9ca5-aa1f5350eaba" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4b0617cc8435">FR30, NFR12</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3abb7b77-d846-4e86-a264-1e484117b878" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dac3ff4f063f">Candidate-approved CV version, recruiter/JD-sc=
oped expiring links, access audit, request-time checks, cache invalidation =
and no public links.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7a0dfa9e-1a0f-434a-afe0-17aea678f919">
<td data-local-id=3D"3a2936fd-0854-422e-ab26-3cad4d3dc30c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9db136046e32">Recruiter request lifecycle and telemetry</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e2b8b1cf-6236-47f9-a23d-1b0c8a04a860" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1ca51cbcc792">FR31, NFR14</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b9dfbbc6-c372-47ac-baec-90ae21c96cb3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8a9a459e500c">Keep separate from candidate application histo=
ry; event definitions, response deduplication, cost and zero-match monitori=
ng.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"145b37585103">Recruiter-side use requires a fresh GDPR/EU AI=
 Act applicability and data-sharing review before pilot access is enabled; =
this is a dependency requiring specialist review, not a legal conclusion. V=
alidate scoring on representative JD/profile pairs, include false exclusion=
s and cohort fairness, and avoid using availability or protected attributes=
 as fit-score components.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"568667b12a50" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-9.OutofScope=
">9. Out of Scope</h2>
<p local-id=3D"61afa15beb8c">The MVP proves explainable candidate-side matc=
hing and includes an invitation-only verified headhunter pilot (FR25=E2=80=
=93FR31). Broad employer self-service, automated submission and additional =
markets remain out of scope.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b=
55be12a3fe4" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e8383035cbc4">
<th data-local-id=3D"d2933d2119c3" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d56f3ce5af85">Item</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"f4610c6d4fac" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0f7fa6d3beb2">MoSCoW</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fde95cd0f3b6" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"db2b14f9641d">Why not in MVP</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6668d6dcfb05">
<td data-local-id=3D"c636e578813e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9acb59dee045">Broad employer talent search and self-service =
CV database search (outside the controlled headhunter pilot)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"310b0c8ef3dd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0a763b148f52"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a5f527e8f91a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"42ed51be993d">Broad employer search requires a larger candid=
ate base and post-launch commercial onboarding. The controlled headhunter p=
ilot is a scoped exception, with consent, verification and availability gat=
es (FR25=E2=80=93FR30).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0f4b51722a5e">
<td data-local-id=3D"5a446953df57" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2cdc00188f77">Paid employer job ads on CareerPilot</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"339bacbaa600" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"51e18f7b1594"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ad1d0651afc2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9da47d748dc0">Post-launch revenue stream together with talen=
t search, behind employer login; the MVP only aggregates ads from the Bunde=
sagentur f=C3=BCr Arbeit's public lists</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b60e6169cb4c">
<td data-local-id=3D"3be6dec1f7d3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2f7ea7e70d5f">Pay as you apply for job seekers (prepaid wall=
et, 10-credit packs at =E2=82=AC0.99)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eda802277cda" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c719f39777f"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9f62a78fb44d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"92d9e90eca69">Shown as "Coming soon" in the MVP; goes live a=
fter launch and never affects ranking</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"371ccc5ba5a9">
<td data-local-id=3D"e67f61cafeb2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5e4b0c3c9437">Auto-apply or bulk submission to employers</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"877ec484e199" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0ee8a4f9a021"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"89024a289daa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"688d358f5699">Contradicts "user stays in control" and fewer,=
 better applications; this is JobCopilot's model, not ours</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2c565550f296">
<td data-local-id=3D"2211f051252f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d1e21446442">Submitting applications into employer ATS syst=
ems</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"816d8dacebc3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3a74d516f195"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aa7fa11568dd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7563ccf2baa1">Integration effort per ATS; MVP users apply on=
 the employer portal with exported documents</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"88b3096d37f7">
<td data-local-id=3D"6991b9d9645e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f986f3b3fa5f">Paid candidate tier that boosts visibility or =
gives earlier alerts</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0371d0a13de1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c38005d9be32"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d6c1cc9baed5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5edf193a22fb">Violates ranking neutrality (NFR1); recreates =
problem P6. Not planned at any stage</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"111a1c1869e6">
<td data-local-id=3D"49ac6039d36c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
