<td data-local-id=3D"537b38a20194" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"70e9e2df1786"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ffbf1f2d57e2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9f4f58e1ff7d">Responsive web covers the journey at lower cos=
t [ASSUMPTION]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8b305a4218f7">
<td data-local-id=3D"ae5bebe4f056" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"af5f36df9b1c">Markets beyond Germany, and languages beyond G=
erman and English</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"140dfa731d72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b4e77be26cd5"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"545dc8b3585b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"890ad96e57ec">Extraction and generation quality must be prov=
en in Germany, in German and English, first; Spain is the second market</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"63d4f6257d9e">
