ng the user's mailbox</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a5ee02ac9cc7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9da264223b6b"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"526b585868cc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"561b9c4e9e1a">Mailbox access raises privacy risk and enginee=
ring effort; manual status in two clicks for MVP</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ef2a7839ba9b">
<td data-local-id=3D"ec4a092689ce" class=3D"confluenceTd">
