<td data-local-id=3D"942e60e23b68" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"24536558e476"><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lo=
zenge-visual-refresh">WON'T</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9d20ebddf69e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9673de2bd9f">The broad employer/recruiter trust indicator s=
tays post-MVP. Basic identity verification, report/block controls and conse=
nt-based contact are required for the controlled headhunter pilot (FR25, FR=
30, NFR12).</p></td>
</tr>
