<h3 local-id=3D"be2208be4f86" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93MVPPRD-Headhunterpi=
lotrollout,gatesandrisks">Headhunter pilot rollout, gates and risks</h3>
<p local-id=3D"66b9ff29deef">The fixed candidate launch on 14 June 2027, te=
am size and existing sprint assignments remain. Headhunter delivery is a se=
parate controlled pilot within the MVP programme; the added work is not ass=
umed to fit into existing sprints. Before G2 the PM and engineering must es=
timate CPA-88/CPA-89 and explicitly reserve capacity or replace agreed stre=
tch work. If the pilot gates fail, retain the candidate launch and keep rec=
ruiter access disabled; report the pilot delay rather than relaxing consent=
 or matching thresholds.</p>
